{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"公園大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/05/11/9823056/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブーン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/05/11/9823056/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポッポ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/05/11/9823056/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鳩とたわむれようとするけどなんだか怖くて腰が引けてる系。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......はいっ！能條です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル東京公演もあと残りわずかになってきましたねぇ～...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか寂しい気もするわ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日、始めていつみに立候補させていただき選んでいただきました(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつみとしてしっかり嫌な女になれたかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの2幕の瞬間だけでも皆さんに嫌いになってもらえるよう頑張りました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、栄に立候補しましたが、駄目でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"栄は前回演じた時に悔いが残ってしまったからどうしてもまた演じたくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もリベンジしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたい事に選んでいただけました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また栄をやらせてもらえた事に感謝ですありがとうございます(/ _ ; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間の反省点をいかしのびのび演じることが出来た気がする。。うん。ん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/05/11/9823056/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は......ちょっと冒険してみようかなと思います❤❤❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへへー楽しみーー  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、練習始めます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/05/11/9823056/0004.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}